!data/model_metadata.sample.json
# The haul-road CENTRELINE is committed, on purpose. It is a road survey --
# km marker, latitude, longitude, road code -- and nothing else: no geofences,
# no loading or dumping zones, no security boundaries, no tonnages. The corridor
# it describes is already rendered by OpenStreetMap. Committing it is what makes
# the section-9 map work on a fresh clone and on the public demo, which
# otherwise showed an empty state. Geofence and zone data stay OUT.
!data/haul_road_chainage_public.csv
# Posted FMS speed-limit zones (chainage + km/h only — no tonnages / GPS tracks).
!data/speed_limit_zones_public.csv

